      "title": "Siena University::: New Jobs",
      "description": "Siena University::: New Jobs http://siena.interviewexchange.com/ New job postings from Siena University en-us Sat, 05 Sep 2026 13:25:34 -0400 Sat, 05 Sep 2026 13:25:34 -0400 http://blogs.law.harvard.edu/tech/rss IE JSP-RSS info@interviewexchange.com (Hirezon Interview Exchange) info@interviewexchange.com (Hirezon Interview Exchange) Adjunct Faculty in Biology - Human Anatomy and Physiology - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203921 Adjunct Faculty Positions Biology Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Adjunct Faculty Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Aug 19 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Siena University&nbsp;Biology Department is accepting applications for adjunct instructors to teach Human Anatomy and Physiology I and II lecture and labs for nursing students for the Fall 2026 semester.&nbsp; Human A&P I and II cover fundamental concepts in the structure and function of the human body. A&P I emphasizes organ systems including the integumentary, muscular and nervous systems, while A&P II emphasizes the respiratory, circulatory, and urinary systems (A&P II). These are part-time positions.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203921\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203921 Adjunct Faculty in Nursing - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202176 Adjunct Faculty Positions Nursing Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Adjunct Faculty Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jul 2 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Siena's Baldwin Nursing Program is seeking applicants for Adjunct Nursing Faculty to begin September 1, 2026; for the Fall 2026 semester. The individuals will teach either a section of our Health Policy in Nursing Practice course (3 contact hours) or one to two clinical sections of our upper division Population and Public Health Nursing Perspectives course (4 contact hours).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For more information about the Nursing Major at Siena, visit our website: https://www.siena.edu/nursing.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n&nbsp;</p><a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202176\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Thu, 02 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202176 Adjunct Faculty in Nursing Leadership - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203582 Adjunct Faculty Positions Nursing Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Adjunct Faculty Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 11 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Siena's Baldwin Nursing Program provides an education that is congruent with Siena mission and learning goals and offers nurses a broader humanistic caring perspective of the discipline of nursing. The Nursing program integrates a caring science curriculum with Franciscan values and a strong education in the liberal arts and sciences. With a focus on mindful learning, reflective practice and the importance of self-care, our caring science teaching-learning philosophy creates an authentic environment to enhance the student's understanding of social, cultural, economic and political issues...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203582\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203582 Adjunct Faculty in Nursing, Informatics - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203581 Adjunct Faculty Positions Nursing Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Adjunct Faculty Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 11 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Siena's Baldwin Nursing Program provides an education that is congruent with Siena mission and learning goals and offers nurses a broader humanistic caring perspective of the discipline of nursing. The Nursing program integrates a caring science curriculum with Franciscan values and a strong education in the liberal arts and sciences. With a focus on mindful learning, reflective practice and the importance of self-care, our caring science teaching-learning philosophy creates an authentic environment to enhance the student's understanding of social, cultural, economic and political issues...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203581\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203581 Adjunct Faculty in Philosophy - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202323 Adjunct Faculty Positions Philosophy Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Adjunct Faculty Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 8 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Philosophy Department at Siena University is looking for adjunct faculty for the Fall 2026 semester to teach one or two in-person sections of PHIL 101: Philosophy and the Human Being, at our campus in Loudonville, NY. Course description can be found on <a href=\"https://catalog.siena.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=20&poid=3045&returnto=725\" target=\"_blank\">Siena's Philosophy B.A. site</a>. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>This is a part-time, one-semester, adjunct faculty position.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The two available course sections meet on Siena's campus as follows:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Mon...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202323\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Wed, 08 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202323 Adjunct Faculty in Psychology - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202327 Adjunct Faculty Positions Psychology Academic / Faculty Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Adjunct Faculty Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 8 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Siena University Department of Psychology is seeking part-time faculty to teach available sections of Introductory/General Psychology during the fall 2026 semester. The courses are to be taught in-person on Siena's Loudonville, NY campus and will be offered at the following days/times.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Monday, Wednesday, & Friday 8 - 9 am, and/or</li><li>Monday, Wednesday, & Friday 9:10 - 10:10 am, and/or</li><li>Tuesday and Thursday 9 - 9:30 am</li></ul><a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202327\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Wed, 08 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202327 Administrative Assistant, Athletics (Part-time) - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203594 Administrative and Staff Positions Athletics Administrative and Professional Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 11 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Siena University, a NCAA Division I institution and member of the Metro Conference, is seeking a part-<br>\r\ntime administrative assistant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Responsibilities include:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Assisting with the department's athletic insurance program</li><li>Providing support to the athletic business operations office</li><li>Assisting with event planning</li><li>Overseeing front office/reception area</li><li>Providing administrative support to the VP/Director of Athletics</li></ul><a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203594\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203594 Assistant Director of Admissions - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203510 Administrative and Staff Positions Admissions Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> New York City Metro Area, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Aug 10 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Assistant Director of Admissions is responsible for executing the recruitment strategy for an assigned undergraduate admissions territory to achieve enrollment goals for Siena University. Serving as Siena's primary representative within the region, this role builds relationships with prospective students, families, school counselors, and community partners while guiding students from inquiry through enrollment.&nbsp; Success in this role requires disciplined execution, exceptional relationship-building skills, effective use of data and technology, and a commitment to delivering an ou...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203510\"> more...</a> New York City Metro Area, NY Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203510 Assistant Vice President for Marketing Strategy - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203797 Administrative and Staff Positions Marketing Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Aug 17 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Assistant Vice President for Marketing Strategy is responsible for developing and advancing Siena<br>\r\nUniversity's institutional and enrollment marketing strategies to strengthen the University's brand, increase<br>\r\nawareness, and support undergraduate and graduate enrollment growth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Working closely with the Dean of Enrollment & Marketing, this role translates institutional priorities into<br>\r\naudience-centered marketing strategies that help Siena stand apart in an increasingly competitive higher<br>\r\neducation marketplace. The Assistant Vice President develops positioni...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203797\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203797 Associate Director of Visit Experience - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203513 Administrative and Staff Positions Admissions Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Aug 10 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Associate Director of Visit Experience is responsible for designing, executing, and continuously improving Siena University's campus visit experience including daily visits and University's signature enrollment events. This role owns the moments that matter most in a prospective student's decision journey, creating experiences that inspire students and families to see themselves at Siena and confidently take the next step toward enrollment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Success in this role is measured by more than flawless event execution. The Associate Director is accountable for increasing visit-to-a...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203513\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203513 Bonner Driver (Part-time) - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202383 Administrative and Staff Positions Conference Services Administrative and Professional Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jul 9 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Bonner Program Driver is responsible for safely transporting Siena University Bonner Program students to and from community service and volunteer sites throughout the Capital Region. This position supports student engagement and community partnerships by providing reliable transportation, helping to ensure students arrive safely and on time for scheduled service activities. The position typically requires availability one to two days per week, with occasional evening or weekend hours as needed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Main Responsibilities Include:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Safely tran...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202383\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Thu, 09 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202383 Chief Nurse Administrator - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199668 Administrative and Staff Positions School of Science Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Apr 21 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Siena University is seeking applicants for a Chief Nurse Administrator (CNA). This position&nbsp;provides effective leadership to the Baldwin Nursing Programs at Siena University in achieving its mission, goals, and expected program outcomes. The CNA is responsible for academic and administrative functions of the programs including curricular coordination, assessment, partnerships with educational and clinical partners, resource management, and recruitment support. This position serves as the official liaison between the University and the Commission on Collegiate Nursing Education (CCNE...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199668\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Tue, 21 Apr 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=199668 Director of Institutional Assessment - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204226 Administrative and Staff Positions Institutional Effectiveness Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Aug 28 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Office of Institutional Effectiveness at Siena University is seeking applications for a full-time administrative position of Director of Institutional Assessment. Reporting to the Associate Vice President of Academic Affairs for Institutional Effectiveness, the Director of Institutional Assessment is a champion for assessment at Siena. The primary responsibilities for this position include managing Siena's two major year-round assessment processes, administrative assessment and academic assessment. This position also supports assessment of the Core curriculum. With the AVPAA-IE, the ...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204226\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Fri, 28 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204226 Director, The MacDonnell Career and Internship Center - Revised compensation and requirements - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202632 Administrative and Staff Positions Career Center Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Jul 14 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Reporting to Associate Provost for Experiential Learning, the Director provides the vision, leadership, and management of The MacDonnell Career and Internship Center (TMCIC), its administrative team, and oversight of all TMCIC initiatives. The Director works with the Associate Provost and the Senior Experiential Learning Team to cultivate a culture of excellence and innovation in experiential learning at Siena University. The ideal candidate will be excited by the opportunity to envision, create, and sustain a campus wide career-readiness ecosystem that supports all students on their jou...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202632\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Tue, 14 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202632 Head Coach - Club Cricket - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202348 Administrative and Staff Positions Student Activities & Leadership Development Administrative and Professional Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jul 9 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Appointment Date: September - May</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Siena College's Head Coach for Club Cricket should understand and exemplify Siena College's mission statement and Franciscan values.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Responsibilities Include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Supervising the organization of a participatory club level cricket program</li><li>Mentoring student athletes' placing a higher focus on academics</li><li>Evaluating the student athletes strengths and weaknesses and providing constructive feedback for improvement</li><li>Being present at all student practices and competitions</li><li>Following the College's expect...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202348\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Thu, 09 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202348 Head Coach - Club Golf - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202344 Administrative and Staff Positions Student Activities & Leadership Development Administrative and Professional Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jul 9 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Appointment Date: September - May</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Siena College's Head Coach for Club Golf should understand and exemplify Siena College's mission statement and Franciscan values.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Responsibilities Include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Supervising the organization of a participatory club level golf program</li><li>Mentoring student athletes' placing a higher focus on academics</li><li>Evaluating the student athletes strengths and weaknesses and providing constructive feedback for improvement</li><li>Being present at all student practices and competitions</li><li>Following the College's expectations...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202344\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Thu, 09 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202344 Head Coach - Club Swim - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202350 Administrative and Staff Positions Student Activities & Leadership Development Administrative and Professional Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jul 9 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Appointment Date: September - May</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Siena College's Head Coach for Club Swim should understand and exemplify Siena College's mission statement and Franciscan values.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Responsibilities Include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Supervising the organization of a participatory club level swim program</li><li>Mentoring student athletes' placing a higher focus on academics</li><li>Evaluating the student athletes strengths and weaknesses and providing constructive feedback for improvement</li><li>Being present at all student practices and competitions</li><li>Following the College's expectations...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202350\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Thu, 09 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202350 Head Coach - Club Ultimate Frisbee - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202351 Administrative and Staff Positions Student Activities & Leadership Development Administrative and Professional Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jul 9 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Appointment Date: September - May</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Siena College's Head Coach for Club Ultimate Frisbee should understand and exemplify Siena College's mission statement and Franciscan values.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Responsibilities Include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Supervising the organization of a participatory club level frisbee program</li><li>Mentoring student athletes' placing a higher focus on academics</li><li>Evaluating the student athletes strengths and weaknesses and providing constructive feedback for improvement</li><li>Being present at all student practices and competitions</li><li>Following the College...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202351\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Thu, 09 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202351 Head Coach - Men's Club Basketball - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202346 Administrative and Staff Positions Student Activities & Leadership Development Administrative and Professional Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jul 9 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Appointment Date: September - May</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Siena College's Head Coach for Men's Club Basketball should understand and exemplify Siena College's mission statement and Franciscan values.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Responsibilities Include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Supervising the organization of a participatory club level basketball program</li><li>Mentoring student athletes' placing a higher focus on academics</li><li>Evaluating the student athletes strengths and weaknesses and providing constructive feedback for improvement</li><li>Being present at all student practices and competitions</li><li>Following the Coll...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202346\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Thu, 09 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202346 Head Coach - Men's Club Soccer - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202352 Administrative and Staff Positions Student Activities & Leadership Development Administrative and Professional Part-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jul 9 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Appointment Date: September - May</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Siena College's Head Coach for Men's Club Soccer should understand and exemplify Siena College's mission statement and Franciscan values.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Responsibilities Include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Supervising the organization of a participatory club level Men's Soccer program</li><li>Mentoring student athletes' placing a higher focus on academics</li><li>Evaluating the student athletes strengths and weaknesses and providing constructive feedback for improvement</li><li>Being present at all student practices and competitions</li><li>Following the Colleg...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202352\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Thu, 09 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202352 Head Coach, Acrobatics & Tumbling - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203095 Administrative and Staff Positions Athletics Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Jul 28 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The head coach is responsible for the operation and management of all aspects of a Division I Acrobatics & Tumbling program. Areas of responsibility include supervision of assistant coach, practice and competition preparation, recruitment of student-athletics, student-athlete development, NCAA Compliance, and external relations. &nbsp;</p><a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203095\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203095 Head Women's Swimming and Diving Coach, Aquatics Director - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203726 Administrative and Staff Positions Athletics Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Aug 14 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Head Women's Swimming and Diving Coach is responsible for the operation and management of all aspects of a Division I Women's Swimming and Diving program. This position also serves as the Aquatics Director.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Women's Swimming and Diving Program</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Oversee practice planning and competition preparation.</li><li>Recruit prospective student-athletes.</li><li>Support and enhance student-athlete development.</li><li>Ensure compliance with NCAA, conference, and institutional rules and regulations.</li><li>Manag...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203726\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203726 Library Business and Operations Manager - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201510 Administrative and Staff Positions Library Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Jun 12 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Standish Library Business and Operations Manager provides oversight of the day-to-day financial and administrative operations of the Library. This position manages all state-aided and allocated budget funds and coordinates procurement, contract and hiring processes. This person also serves as a liaison with campus partners and external entities and it is actively involved in facilities planning and projects. The Business and Operations Manager plays a critical role in ensuring efficient operations that support the library's teaching, research, and service mission.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Main Resp...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201510\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Fri, 12 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=201510 Major Gift Officer (2 Positions Available) - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203604 Administrative and Staff Positions Development & External Affairs Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Aug 12 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Siena University is seeking an accomplished, dynamic, and results-oriented Major Gift Officer (MGO) to serve as a primary ambassador for the University's philanthropic vision. As a frontline fundraiser, the MGO is responsible for managing a portfolio of high-capacity prospects and advancing philanthropic support for Siena's strategic priorities, including capital, endowment, and annual initiatives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Reporting to the Assistant Vice President for Individua