the Siena University&nbsp;Community by providing professional supportive services to students, employees and visitors. Duties include (but not limited to):</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Campus patrol by vehicle, bicycle and foot</li><li>Ensure compliance with: college rules, traffic rules & laws and ordinances</li><li>Physical security checks</li><li>Access control</li><li>Motorist assistance</li><li>Computer aided dispatch and CCTV monitoring</li><li>Report writing&nbsp;</li><li>Community outreach and training</li></ul>\r\n\r\n...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203080\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203080 Senior Accountant - Investments and Treasury - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204410 Administrative and Staff Positions Finance Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Loudonville, NY <B> Category: </B> Administrative and Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Sep 2 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Senior Accountant supports the Controller's Office through responsibility for investment accounting, treasury activities, payroll accounting, financial compliance, reconciliation processes, and audit support. This position plays a leadership role in strengthening internal controls and ensuring compliance with accounting standards and University policies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li><strong>General Accounting and Financial Reporting</strong>- Prepare and review monthly reconciliations and analyses for investment, treasury, payroll, and other general ...<a href=\"http://siena.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204410\"> more...</a> Loudonville, NY Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204410 Senior Associate Director of Admissions - Siena University http://siena.interviewexchange.com/j